# TradeLens

A full-stack trading analytics platform that imports MetaTrader 5 trades, analyses performance, and visualises trades on TradingView-style charts.

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React, TypeScript, Tailwind, Lightweight Charts
- Backend: FastAPI, PostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy
- Data Source: MetaTrader 5

## Project Structure
- `/frontend` - React app
- `/backend` - FastAPI API
- `/docs` - architecture notes, roadmap, screenshots

## Features
- MT5 trade import
- P&L analytics
- risk-to-reward calculations
- trade chart overlays
- performance breakdowns

